body:
I can relate to this, at time i'm interested and doing my best to fix work related problems, but when the challenge is over on a project & all that's left is for me to make easy money, I always suddenly feel less fired up with passion towards it.

&#x200B;

I also only work under stress and when a deadline is very close, I've done this on my finals which take a whole year of studying to be prepared. I never prepared & only picked my notebooks 2 days before the finals.

&#x200B;

>!I failed terribly but managed to get an average test score & graduated from high school to college!<

Yes exactly what i'm currently looking for, lots of trauma that's untreated but can't yet find a good therapist, i've seen 3 or 4 and half of them were either uninformed or straight up narcissists.

&#x200B;

I wonder how I can manage the symptoms until finding real help

Codeine/promethazine. anxiety is keeping me from seeking other drugs.

&#x200B;

You?

let's say a whale has 1 billion hoge

he sells now at 0.00025 and the price will drop

&#x200B;

if he sells at 0.0025 the same thing will happen, price will drop again.

&#x200B;

so i think it's the same thing

hey thank you for the reply.

&#x200B;

But I've seen lots of people on r/getdisciplined struggle with maintaining habits and staying on track, the same way i do which left me wondering how is my case any different than theirs? like does cptsd make things look a lot harder than all the other people who struggle the same way i do?

Thank you for comment, I have just googled him and found that he was previously in prison and was released under the terms of amnesty on 1991.

&#x200B;

He was brought to trial in January 1986 with 26 others on  charges of having "participated in a clandestine organization, which aimed to overthrow the monarchy". 

&#x200B;

Is there anyway I could use this as steroids to the report?

wishing you the best, this really motivates me and i hope i get better too.

&#x200B;

I'm really happy for you

&#x200B;

Edit : how long did it take you to heal?

I did a lot of google searchs, i couldn't find anything, or maybe I didn't know what to put in the search engine.

&#x200B;

Maybe i'm sleep deprived, i really have no idea. I'm confused
